  "releaseNotes": "UnitOfWorkBehavior returns a retryable TransientPersistenceError (instead of throwing) for deadlocks, serialization failures, and other provider-transient failures in transactions it owns; UnitOfWorkOptions.TransientFailureHandling = Throw keeps the previous behavior. Adds DbContext.LockRowAsync for explicit, provider-aware row lock ordering (PostgreSQL). Now references Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore.Relational.",
